@@ -1,5 +1,19 @@
 # Configuration
 
+## Tailnet identity
+
+An installed Identity Boundaries plugin is selected automatically when the server
+has `BB_TAILNET_IDENTITY_OWNED_HOST` set to its Tailscale Serve authority. BB derives
+the standard loopback Serve ingress and identity-header mapping; no second
+`BB_P6R_IDENTITY_BOUNDARY` opt-in is required. An explicitly supplied boundary
+still takes precedence for custom providers or ingress mappings.
+
+The plugin checks the request authority and resolves Serve's login against its
+Tailnet directory. Requests without usable person evidence retain machine
+attribution. This is attribution, not a replacement for access controls. A local
+or tagged-machine CLI request cannot verify which person is using a browser.
+Changing the server environment requires a restart.
+
 The packaged `npx bb-app` flow stores persistent package settings under
 `~/.bb/config.json`, provider environment values under `~/.bb/env.json`, and
 client SSH target mappings under `~/.bb/client.json`.
